{
  "bodyHash": "tchV4iM5eqI=",
  "content": "<h6><img src=\"https://imgbox.com/9ZhO1Brl\" alt=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Sd6qf5g.png\" width=\"1138\" height=\"419\"></span></h6><h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xH3yamW.png\" width=\"1126\" height=\"67\"></span></h6><h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#800000\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">格努姆斯定居點</span> </strong></span> - 為遊戲添加新生物、小型建築與定居點、新實用物品與裝飾方塊的模組。所有建築都會在其他模組的任何生態域中自由生成，新生物也是如此。這個模組將豐富你的世界，使其更生動，而新物品則能幫助你生存。</span></h6><h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;color:#000\">模組中的武器可與</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat 搭配使用。</a></span></h6><h6><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">此模組是使用</span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcreator.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong> MCreator</strong></a></span><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">製作的。</span></h6><h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;color:#800000\"><strong>影片與評論</strong></span></h6><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;color:#030\">評論</span></strong></span></h4>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Wo4pRxGsgZM?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wN1gUw3oEIg?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uyaQqXpjrlc?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n</div><h6><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></h6><h6><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\">模組需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#030\"><strong>GeckoLib</strong></span></a> 才能運作。若遇到動畫問題，請在光影設定中停用實體陰影，並盡可能使用較舊版本的 Geckolib，例如 4.2.1 版。</span></span></h6><h6><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GbPTj7m.png\" width=\"272\" height=\"80\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/udPMvvcmKF\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tVDySjF.png\" width=\"272\" height=\"80\"></a><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><a href=\"https://patreon.com/MongooseMods?utm_medium=unknown&amp;utm_source=join_link&amp;utm_campaign=creatorshare_creator&amp;utm_content=copyLink\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ng7ualq.png\" width=\"274\" height=\"80\"></a><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SFDrf2U.png\" width=\"1126\" height=\"67\"></span></span></h6><h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">模組新增了數種新生物，主要為格努姆斯變種。有些生物會自然生成，有些則只會在新建築中生成。狩獵某些生物可獲得帶有隨機戰利品的熊，因此每次擊殺敵人都可能帶來新收穫。</span></h6><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>格努姆斯獵人</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OAPzXNh.png\" width=\"315\" height=\"514\"></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">可在夜間像普通怪物一樣找到（可使用 /gamerule 指令停用其外觀，之後只會在定居點和建築中出現）。獵人名副其實，會攻擊玩家以及豬、羊、兔等動物（但殺死動物後有較長間隔）。所以請讓你的牲畜遠離這些傢伙。</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">掉落物：</span></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/M8K9GBt.png\" width=\"326\" height=\"73\"></span></h6>\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800000;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>格努姆斯戰士</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800000\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qFk5aF6.png\" width=\"493\" height=\"422\"></strong></span></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">與格努姆斯獵人類似，但不會獵殺動物，且擁有更高的傷害與護甲。僅在定居點和建築中出現。</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800000\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000\">掉落物：</span></span></span></strong></span></h6>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800000\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xah711G.png\" width=\"304\" height=\"89\"></span></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px\"><strong style=\"color:#800000;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">格努姆斯工人</strong></span></p>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bPCaE2U.png\" width=\"282\" height=\"404\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">與獵人不同，工人僅在定居點出現，且不願輕易投入戰鬥；在較近距離發現玩家，但戰鬥力較弱。</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">掉落物：</span></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nZNGJhq.png\" width=\"242\" height=\"71\"></span></strong></span></h6>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>格努姆斯薩滿</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FThdgFW.png\" width=\"354\" height=\"437\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">僅在最大型定居點中出現。能進行近戰與遠程戰鬥。遠程戰鬥使用魔法，擊中玩家時會施加虛弱效果，擊中其他格努姆斯則會提升其力量，不過其他格努姆斯可能不領情……</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">掉落物：</span></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NeKVmio.png\" width=\"279\" height=\"79\"></span></strong></span></h6>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>格努姆斯商人</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XOvOzci.png\" width=\"306\" height=\"402\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">對玩家中立的格努姆斯。會週期性地在世界中遊蕩。你可以給他（右鍵）格努姆斯達布隆或格努姆斯達布隆堆來進行交易。他會回贈包裝好的商品。給他一堆格努姆斯達布隆能保證你得到更珍貴的包裝商品。若攻擊格努姆斯，他會施加詛咒，使你暫時無法與格努姆斯商人交易。</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">掉落物：</span></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/t439U3K.png\" width=\"199\" height=\"94\"></strong></span></h6>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>有袋鼠</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q9UJe0Y.png\" width=\"390\" height=\"209\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">中立動物。可在世界各地（寒冷生態域除外）找到。若玩家攻擊老鼠，牠會召喚3隻小老鼠，與成年鼠一同攻擊玩家。但若給老鼠格努姆斯起司，牠會回贈隨機貴重物品，最常見的是復古金屬。</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">掉落物：</span></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XQADtTg.png\" width=\"93\" height=\"105\"></span></strong></span></h6>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>投手鼠</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rnEk7nt.png\" width=\"246\" height=\"149\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">有較小機率在打破戰利品壺時遇到，或攻擊有袋鼠時出現。受驚的老鼠會立即攻擊玩家。雖然弱小，但極其敏捷且體型小，難以擊中。</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>大鼻子</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xhCd8mP.png\" width=\"492\" height=\"258\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">常見於大多數溫暖或溫帶草地生態域的小群體中。對玩家中立，成年和幼年個體都可能反擊。可用過熟胡蘿蔔繁殖。是鮮肉的來源。</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">掉落物：</span></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6bGgdBR.png\" width=\"98\" height=\"98\"></span></strong></span></h6>\n</div><h5>&nbsp;</h5><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ECOxggV.png\" width=\"1127\" height=\"69\"></p><h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">模組新增了多種實用物品，無論在遊戲前期還是後期都能派上用場。大多數物品從生物、壺或寶箱中掉落，有些則需透過與其他生物互動獲得。此外還新增了一套裝飾方塊，主要用於構成新建築。</span></h6><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>格努穆斯袋</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/X9o7qGN.png\" width=\"379\" height=\"133\"></span></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">你可以透過擊殺格努穆斯、打破罐子或在格努穆斯聚落的寶箱中獲得。按下右鍵即可打開袋子，獲得隨機戰利品形式的內容物以及若干經驗值。袋子分為三種稀有度，稀有度越高，戰利品越有價值，但最小的袋子可能為空。</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>包裹貨物</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/t439U3K.png\" width=\"364\" height=\"172\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">透過與格努穆斯商人交易獲得。有兩種稀有度。打開時會獲得一個隨機物品和一張紙。較稀有的包裹會掉落更有價值的物品。</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>格努穆斯爪</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4SHMaWi.png\" width=\"179\" height=\"151\"><br></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">格努穆斯的爪子能帶來好運，因此用爪子製作的道具將具有特殊屬性。</span></h6>\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800000;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>格努穆斯角</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800000;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/M4ZDn6u.png\" width=\"169\" height=\"169\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">格努穆斯獵人、薩滿和戰士的稀有掉落物。</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>格努穆斯鎬和格努穆斯彎刀</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/il0YuN5.png\" width=\"391\" height=\"189\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">用格努穆斯爪製作。在製作物品時具有特殊屬性，鎬會獲得第三等級的幸運附魔，彎刀則獲得搶奪附魔。然而，這些工具的耐久度極低，只能使用幾次，因此請謹慎使用。</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">你可以用復合金錠升級這些物品，這將大幅提升這些工具的耐久度和效率。</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pn0q62E.png\" width=\"393\" height=\"190\"></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>幸運帽</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/a7DxzW1.png\" width=\"220\" height=\"186\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">為佩戴者帶來好運。同時也能提升與格努穆斯商人的交易品質。</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>生意帽</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vXQRw2n.png\" width=\"218\" height=\"218\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">裝備時給予村民永久折扣。與格努穆斯商人交易時作為稀有物品掉落。</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>格努穆斯金幣</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g33bCPM.png\" width=\"234\" height=\"175\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">可以熔煉成金粒，熔煉時會提供大量經驗值。在高爐中熔煉可獲得更多經驗。也可用於與格努穆斯商人交易。</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>格努穆斯起司</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2PbaHX6.png\" width=\"232\" height=\"241\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">可從格努穆斯袋、打破罐子或在格努穆斯聚落的寶箱中獲得。食用後如同牛奶一樣解除所有效果。你可以將其餵給有袋鼠，以獲得隨機獎勵。</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>過熟胡蘿蔔</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AAGsnAt.png\" width=\"229\" height=\"229\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">收穫成熟的胡蘿蔔時會偶爾掉落。用於繁殖大鼻子豬。</span></h6>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800000;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>格努穆斯鷹嘴豆</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1B0RbTx.png\" width=\"226\" height=\"226\"></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;color:#000\">一種小型食物來源，可在寶箱、罐子或格努穆斯袋中找到。是製作格努穆斯鷹嘴豆泥的原料。也可用於繁殖大鼻子豬。</span></h6>\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800000;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>格努穆斯鷹嘴豆泥</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800000;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Yy1oUm.png\" width=\"283\" height=\"283\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">是一種良好的食物來源，食用後提供30秒的吸收效果。</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>多汁肉塊</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/N9qVMN7.png\" width=\"341\" height=\"164\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">透過擊殺大鼻子豬獲得。烤熟後食用，會提供一個短期效果，使你的飽和度保持在最大值。</span></h6>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h6><strong style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">豐盛大餐</span></strong></h6>\n<p><strong style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wL8cemn.png\" width=\"284\" height=\"237\"></span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">這道菜融合了多種食材，食用後具有「飽足食物」的持久特性。在此效果影響下，你的飽和度指示器將始終保持在最大值。</span></p>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>復古金屬</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/t9MLAu2.png\" width=\"349\" height=\"134\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">極其稀有，可從格努穆斯袋和寶箱中獲得，但獲得這種金屬最有效的方法是將格努穆斯起司餵給有袋鼠。將數個碎片與銅結合後，你將獲得一個可用於製作和升級新工具的錠。</span></h6>\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800000;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>格努穆斯圖騰</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800000\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mFu11vW.png\" width=\"188\" height=\"188\"></span></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800000\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#000;font-size:14px\">當你手持此物品，且飽食度在6（3個雞腿圖示）或以下時，它會完全恢復你的飢餓值和飽和度。</span></span></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>復古零件</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xyQvsVv.png\" width=\"168\" height=\"168\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">定期從格努穆斯袋中掉落，也可作為與格努穆斯商人交易時的隨機物品，或餵食有袋鼠時獲得。是某些合成中的組件，多餘的可以熔煉成復古金屬。</span></h6>\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800000;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>格努穆斯頭盔</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800000;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FelBIgF.png\" width=\"210\" height=\"210\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">穿戴時，如果你的飽食度處於最大值，你將獲得力量、抗性和挖掘加速的效果。</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>復古步槍</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lbTa1Ex.png\" width=\"432\" height=\"157\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">強大的遠程武器。使用復古子彈作為彈藥。射擊前有短暫延遲，並且射擊後需要重新裝填。</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>復古萬用工具</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oNHttTf.png\" width=\"403\" height=\"385\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">一種極其高效的工具，能夠挖掘任何類型的方塊，當你按下Shift+右鍵時，它會啟動一個暫時的加速挖掘模式，提高方塊挖掘速度，並允許你挖掘3x3的區域。效果結束後，你將有一段時間無法使用加速挖掘。</span></h6>\n</div><h6>&nbsp;</h6><h6><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OfcqOBW.png\" width=\"1126\" height=\"69\"></h6><h6><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">此模組新增了多種建築，例如前聚落的小型廢墟，以及完整的格努穆斯聚落。在新的建築中，你將能找到寶箱和罐子，破壞它們即可獲得隨機戰利品。所有建築會生成在任何適合土壤類型和溫度的生態域中，包括其他模組的生態域。你也可以使用/gamerule指令或在創建世界時透過相同的遊戲規則，單獨禁用每個建築的生成。</span></h6><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>小型遺跡</strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/11sN54i.png\" width=\"1113\" height=\"598\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#800000\"><strong>小型格努姆斯遺跡</strong></span></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/thUUCCH.png\" width=\"1113\" height=\"576\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#800000\"><strong>格努姆斯遺跡</strong></span></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lqEFBWK.png\" width=\"1113\" height=\"597\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#800000\"><strong>格努姆斯雕像</strong></span></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bbqeceO.png\" width=\"1113\" height=\"590\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#800000\"><strong>格努姆斯營火</strong></span></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Lwv9mFl.png\" width=\"1113\" height=\"584\"></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#800000\">格努姆斯營地</span></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IKWtIf2.png\" width=\"1113\" height=\"584\"></span></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#800000\">小型格努姆斯聚落</span></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uX3X9DM.png\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1002\"></span></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#800000\">格努姆斯聚落</span></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iYZWVnr.png\" width=\"1113\" height=\"582\"></span></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"color:#800000\">大型格努姆斯聚落</span></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Xnm9vuY.png\" width=\"1113\" height=\"623\"></span></strong><strong><span style=\"color:#800000\">格努姆斯農場</span></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iXtiIOI.png\" width=\"1113\" height=\"589\"></span></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800000\">商旅驛站</span></strong></span></h6>\n<h6><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rhJFAXk.png\" width=\"1113\" height=\"591\"></span></strong></span></h6>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800000\">薩滿小屋</span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vEZRQT4.png\" width=\"1903\" height=\"972\"></span></strong></span></p>\n</div><h4>&nbsp;</h4><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5Y2hCs6.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"94\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hLXIbyT.png\" width=\"413\" height=\"207\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/royal-variations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/O0bVN74.png\" width=\"393\" height=\"223\"></a></p>",
